              22                     !>@brief The module 'gfdl_cloud_microphys' contains the full GFDL cloud
              23                     !! microphysics (Chen and Lin 2013) \cite chen2013seasonal and (Zhou et al. 2019) \cite zhou2019toward.
              24                     !>@details The module is paired with 'fv_cmp', which performs the "fast"
              25                     !! processes
              26                     !>author Shian-Jiann Lin, Linjiong Zhou
              27                     
              28                     ! =======================================================================
              29                     ! cloud micro - physics package for gfdl global cloud resolving model
              30                     ! the algorithms are originally derived from lin et al 1983. most of the
              31                     ! key elements have been simplified / improved. this code at this stage
              32                     ! bears little to no similarity to the original lin mp in zetac.
              33                     ! therefore, it is best to be called gfdl micro - physics (gfdl mp) .
              34                     ! developer: Shian-Jiann lin, Linjiong Zhou
              35                     ! =======================================================================
              36                     
